          "end": 26.583,
          "en": "to start that NextJS Development Server.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 28.53,
          "end": 31.35,
          "en": "Now in that project I provided to you,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 31.35,
          "end": 34.26,
          "en": "you'll find a couple of folders and files,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 34.26,
          "end": 36.69,
          "en": "and you, of course, already know",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 36.69,
          "end": 39.63,
          "en": "this General NextJS project structure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 39.63,
          "end": 43.71,
          "en": "because as I mentioned, I do assume that you finished",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 43.71,
          "end": 46.29,
          "en": "that NextJS Essentials module.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 46.29,
          "end": 50.73,
          "en": "So I will not reintroduce you to this structure.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 50.73,
          "end": 53.01,
          "en": "Instead, in this starting project,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 53.01,
          "end": 57.42,
          "en": "you'll note that we have a fairly trivial app folder,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 57.42,
          "end": 60.54,
          "en": "which in the end only contains an icon.jpg file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 60.54,
          "end": 65.54,
          "en": "which, well, is the favicon that is shown for this page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 65.67,
          "end": 66.81,
          "en": "And as you learned,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 66.81,
          "end": 70.41,
          "en": "if you have a file named icon.jpg in the app folder,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 70.41,
          "end": 73.94200000000001,
          "en": "it will automatically be used by NextJS",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 73.94200000000001,
          "end": 77.03999999999999,
          "en": "as a favicon for this page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 77.03999999999999,
          "end": 80.37,
          "en": "You have a globals.css file with some styles",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 80.37,
          "end": 83.07,
          "en": "that we'll use throughout this section.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 83.07,
          "end": 86.7,
          "en": "Obviously, you can change those if you wanna tweak the look",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 86.7,
          "end": 89.16,
          "en": "of this demo application.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 89.16,
          "end": 92.88,
          "en": "And we got a very basic layout, which sets up some metadata",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 92.88,
          "end": 96.63,
          "en": "and then a very basic shell for our pages.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 96.63,
          "end": 100.41,
          "en": "And then a very simple page.js file for the homepage.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 100.41,
          "end": 102.03,
          "en": "Nothing too fancy.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 102.03,
          "end": 106.25999999999999,
          "en": "And therefore, if you visit local host 3000,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 106.25999999999999,
          "end": 109.083,
          "en": "you should see this on the screen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 110.31,
          "end": 115.08,
          "en": "And now I got a little challenge, a little exercise for you",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 115.08,
          "end": 120.08,
          "en": "to practice what you already learned earlier in this course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 120.15,
          "end": 125.15,
          "en": "because I want you to use your existing NextJS knowledge",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 125.22,
          "end": 129.66,
          "en": "to add two new pages to this starting application",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 129.66,
          "end": 131.82,
          "en": "I provided to you.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 131.82,
          "end": 135.63,
          "en": "You should add a /news page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 135.63,
          "end": 140.63,
          "en": "so which can be visited if you enter local host 3000/news,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 141.12,
          "end": 144.51,
          "en": "which shows a list of dummy news items.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 144.51,
          "end": 148.38,
          "en": "Because the dummy app we're going to build in this section",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 148.38,
          "end": 152.94,
          "en": "is a fictional, very simple news site.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 152.94,
          "end": 156.27,
          "en": "So I want you to show a list of news items",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 156.27,
          "end": 157.95,
          "en": "which can be clicked.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 157.95,
          "end": 160.07999999999998,
          "en": "So these items should be links.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 160.07999999999998,
          "end": 164.94,
          "en": "And these links should take you to a news detail page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 164.94,
          "end": 169.94,
          "en": "which is /news/ and then some ID, some identifier",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 171.06,
          "end": 174,
          "en": "of a specific news item.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 174,
          "end": 176.01,
          "en": "Now at this point here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 176.01,
          "end": 180.27,
          "en": "we, of course, don't have any real data to work with yet.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 180.27,
          "end": 182.76,
          "en": "So you can simply output some dummy links",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 182.76,
          "end": 186.63,
          "en": "that lead to any news with any idea of your choice.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 186.63,
          "end": 189.99,
          "en": "And then just always show the same details page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 189.99,
          "end": 192.54,
          "en": "for the news item that is loaded.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 192.54,
          "end": 195.273,
          "en": "We don't need any real data yet.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 196.35,
          "end": 198.66,
          "en": "As a little bonus, though,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 198.66,
          "end": 203.37,
          "en": "you can try to extract that identifier",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 203.37,
          "end": 208.37,
          "en": "that will be encoded in the URL of that news item page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 208.5,
          "end": 211.26,
          "en": "and output it on that news item page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 211.26,
          "end": 213.93,
          "en": "just so that you use your knowledge",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 213.93,
          "end": 218.28,
          "en": "about extracting that encoded URL data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 218.28,
          "end": 220.98,
          "en": "That's a little bonus, but the main task is to have",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 220.98,
          "end": 224.34,
          "en": "these two pages that link to each other.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 224.34,
          "end": 228.06,
          "en": "And then there also is another task for you",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 228.06,
          "end": 232.92000000000002,
          "en": "because I also want you to add a main header component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 232.92000000000002,
          "end": 236.22,
          "en": "a separate component that you should build,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 236.22,
          "end": 238.74,
          "en": "add it to this website.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 238.74,
          "end": 242.58,
          "en": "And in that header, you should have two links,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 242.58,
          "end": 245.73,
          "en": "one leading to the starting page, the homepage,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 245.73,
          "end": 248.853,
          "en": "and the other one leading to that news page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 249.93,
          "end": 252.63,
          "en": "That's my task for you.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 252.63,
          "end": 255.693,
          "en": "We'll build this together in the next lecture.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
